<title>UK: CU to restructure UK general insurance ops.</title>
<headline>CU to restructure UK general insurance ops.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>British composite insurer Commercial Union Plc announced a major restructuring of its UK general insurance operations on Tuesday designed to improve profitability and customer service.</p>
<p>The company said the shake-up would deliver &quot;significant added value&quot; of the order of 100 million pounds ($163.5 million) annually by 1999.</p>
</text>
